<title>USA: Beneficial Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Beneficial Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary	    $  0.40		   $ 0.10</p>
<p> Net			 23,300		    6,900</p>
<p>			  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 5.08		    $2.72</p>
<p> Net			281,000		  150,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate Q4 $0.61</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate annual $5.29</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said 1995 reflects a $25.0 million aftertax ($0.47 per share) provision for credit losses related to the company's German consumer banking subsidiary and a $5.9 million aftertax ($0.11 per shr) provision for restructuring.</p>
<p>Without including the restructuring charges and credit loss, the company's 1995 fourth quarter EPS was $0.68.</p>
<p>--- New York Newsdesk</p>
